BAB II
ASAS DAN TUJUAN
Pasal 2
Asas-asas dalam Pemberdayaan perempuan dan perlindungan anak ini adalah: a. Non diskriminasi;
b. Kepentingan terbaik bagi anak;
c. Hakuntukhidup, kelangsungan hidup dan perkembangan;
d. Penghargaan terhadap pendapat anak;
- 7 -
e. Kesetaraan gender;
f. Keadilan gender;
g. Kepastian hukum

translated_text:
CHAPTER II
PRINCIPLES AND OBJECTIVES
Article 2
The principles in the Empowerment of women and protection of children are: a. Non-discrimination;
b. Best interests of the child;
c. Right to life, survival and development;
d. Respect for the views of the child;
- 7 -
e. Gender equality;
f. Gender justice;
g. Legal certainty

Article 5
In order to realize the objectives as referred to in Article 3 letter b, efforts shall be made through:
a. establishment, development, and capacity strengthening of institutions for the protection of women and children including complaint service units for violence against women and children, as well as legal aid services;
b. improvement of the quality of human resources management;
c. institutional capacity strengthening of Gender Mainstreaming (PUG) and children;
d. strengthening and development of gender and children data systems.

text:
Pasal 7
Upaya promotif sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 6 adalah sebagai berikut: a. memperkuat mekanisme koordinasi dan jejaring antar unit layanan dalam  upaya penanganan kasus-kasus kekerasan;
b. menyediakan materi-materi Komunikasi, Informasi, dan Edukasi (KIE) terkait  pencegahan dan penanganan kekerasan;
c. menyelenggarakan sosialisasi, advokasi dan kampanye sosial dalam rangka  pencegahan dan penanganan kekerasan.

translated_text:
Article 7
Promotive efforts as referred to in Article 6 are as follows: a. strengthening coordination mechanisms and networks between service units in efforts to handle cases of violence;
b. providing Communication, Information, and Education (IEC) materials related to prevention and handling of violence;
c. conducting socialization, advocacy and social campaigns in the context of prevention and handling of violence.

text:
Pasal 8
Upaya preventif sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 6adalah sebagai berikut: a. mengadakan penyuluhan kesadaran hukum bagi masyarakat khususnya bagi  perempuan dan anak;
b. mengadakan gerakan masif dan berkelanjutan yang melibatkan masyarakat  dalam aksi pencegahan dan penanganan kekerasan;
c. menanamkan nilai-nilai karakter, budi pekerti, dan ketahanan keluarga; d. melibatkan peran dan partisipasi masyarakat dalam pemberdayaan  perempuan dan perlindungan anak.

translated_text:
Article 8
Preventive measures as referred to in Article 6 are as follows:
a. conducting legal awareness education for the community, especially for women and children;
b. conducting massive and sustainable movements involving the community in prevention and handling of violence;
c. instilling character values, morals, and family resilience;
d. involving the role and participation of the community in women's empowerment and child protection.

text:
Pasal 9
Upaya kuratif sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 6 adalah sebagai berikut : a. mengoptimalkan layanan teknis terkait pengaduan kekerasan terhadap  perempuan dan anak;
b. menyediakan sarana dan prasarana yang memadai untuk penanganan  rehabilitasi kesehatan, rehabilitasi sosial, pemulangan, reintegrasi sosial, dan  bantuan hukum;
c. melakukan penanganan bagi korban kejahatan dan kekerasan secara cepat,  tepat, dan akurat oleh aparat penegak hukum.

translated_text:
Article 9
Curative efforts as referred to in Article 6 are as follows: a. optimizing technical services related to complaints of violence against women and children;
b. providing adequate facilities and infrastructure for handling health rehabilitation, social rehabilitation, repatriation, social reintegration, and legal assistance;
c. conducting handling for victims of crime and violence quickly, precisely, and accurately by law enforcement officials.

text:
Pasal 12
(1) Pemerintah Daerah, masyarakat, lembaga swadaya masyarakat, atau  lembaga-lembaga lain membentuk unit layanan teknis dalam mewujudkan  sistem pemberdayaan perempuan dan perlindungan anak yang terintegrasi,  satu atap dan berjejaring;
(2) Unit layanan teknis sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) adalah P2TP2A.

translated_text:
Article 12
(1) Regional Government, community, non-governmental organizations, or other institutions establish technical service units in realizing an integrated, one-stop and networked system for women's empowerment and child protection;
(2) The technical service unit as referred to in paragraph (1) is P2TP2A.

text:
Pasal 20
Koordinasi dapat dilakukan dalam bentuk :
a. rapat koordinasi dengan jejaring kerja;
b. konsultasi;
c. penyampaian data dan informasi; dan/atau
d. tindak lanjut penanganan kasus.

translated_text:
Article 20
Coordination may be conducted in the form of:
a. coordination meetings with work networks;
b. consultation;
c. submission of data and information; and/or
d. follow-up on case handling.
